    "notes": "Inspected all 12 views. Open upper shelving with pierced geometric galleries, two drawers and a cupboard with a cast brass ring pull below. Carved detail is real geometry, visible in the raking orbits. Back and bottom views confirm a properly closed carcass with plausible plain rear panelling. 15.7k tris.",
